! Chat 2 is resolved. Now, Chats 3 and 4 have their last messages integrated, which is incredible. I\'m focusing on the state lists within `App.tsx` and ensuring persistence with `localStorage` for complete data retention. Initializing and updating the state on mount is the priority. The UI flow and tab behavior now operate as expected, with `currentUser` determining navigation. I\'m taking the layout wrapper of `App.tsx` and finalizing the header, body, and footer structure, depending on the `currentTab`.\n\n\n"
